Note: `make -C sim socrtl` as written on 4c5a51a stops with
"cannot load ../build/soc-tests/crypto_soc_test.bin": the recipe
cd's into build/sim, so the firmware path is resolved relative
to the wrong directory. The two soc_rtl_tb runs above use the
same commands with absolute firmware paths. That target is not
changed in this PR.

